3. FONTS
   No font files are included. They are generated at build time from the fonts
   already installed with the game, on the user's own machine.


NOT INCLUDED

This repository contains no files from the game. The build reads the copy you
already own.

This project is an unofficial community translation and is not affiliated with
or endorsed by the authors of Black Reliquary or Red Hook Studios.
